#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement inverseCosineInPrincipalRange acos returns the principal value of the inverse cosine, in radians, in [0, pi], for arguments in its domain [-1, +1].
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement outOfDomainIsNanSpecialValuesPropagate acos of an argument outside [-1, +1] (including +-Infinity) is NaN; acos(NaN) is NaN.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
