#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement quadrantAwareArcTangentOfTwoArguments atan2(y, x) returns the angle in radians, in (-pi, +pi], from the positive x-axis to the point (x, y), using the signs of both arguments to determine the quadrant.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
