>## @requirement ieeeSpecialValueMatrix atan2 follows the IEEE 754 9.2 special-value table for signed-zero, infinite, and NaN arguments in either position, including the cross-infinity combinations where this implementation returns NaN.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
