#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement roundsTowardPositiveInfinityAsFloat ceiling returns the smallest integer value not less than the argument, as a float64.
