>## The sine of a floating-point number.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>##
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## Sine of an angle in radians, correctly rounded for finite arguments. The result is in [-1, +1]; sin(ଐ) = ଐ; sin(±∞) is NaN (with invalid-operation exception in IEEE 754); sin(NaN) is NaN.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## Corresponds to the IEEE 754 ੹.2 sin operation and to Haskell's sin :: Double -> Double.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>##
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @availableSince 0.15
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement sineOfAngleInRadians sin returns the sine of an angle in radians, correctly rounded for finite arguments, in the range [-1, +1].
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement undefinedAtInfinityNanPropagates sin of +-Infinity is NaN (not a finite oscillation); sin(NaN) is NaN.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>primitive sin : ∀.float64 → float64
