#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement hyperbolicSineDefinedForAllFiniteReals sinh returns the hyperbolic sine, defined for every finite real argument.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
